    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "annotation_marker": "c10",
   "annotation_type": "footnote",
   "annotation_text": "Recommended at ETV based on judgment of the investigator and after discussion with the sponsor ’s medical monitor. If not performed at ETV, this will not be considered a protocol deviation. Recommended at ETV based on judgment of the investigator and after discussion with the sponsor ’s medical monitor. Instructions for collection are provided in the lab manual. Flexible sigmoidoscopy is recommended, except for protocol-specified reasons when a colonoscopy should be performed. If not performed at ETV, this will not be considered a protocol deviation.",
